  "job": "Keep a narrow block readable on a wide page.",
  "purpose": "A bounded column with a maximum width (data-size xs, sm, md, lg or xl) that stays centred when data-align=\"center\". Use it so text and forms stop at a readable measure while the page stays wide.",
